{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08932","headline":"杂言用投丹阳知己兼奉宣慰判官 · 李白","name":"杂言用投丹阳知己兼奉宣慰判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客从崑仑来，遗我双玉璞。\n云是古之得道者西王母食之余，食之可以凌太虚。\n受之颇谓绝今昔，求识江淮人犹乎比石。\n如今虽在卞和手，□□正憔悴。\n了了知之亦何益，恭闻士有调相如。\n始从镐京还，复欲镐京去。\n能上秦王殿，何时回光一相眄。\n欲投君，保君年，幸君持取无弃捐。\n无弃捐，服之与君俱神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}